{
  "summary": "The experiment tested a multimodal model using scvi_n200 RNA and imagenet_vit_l image encoders with None aggregation and concat fusion, isolating these design choices. Validation accuracy of 0.532 and F1 of 0.517 are lower than the prior multimodal baseline (config_007) using weighted fusion and transformer aggregation, suggesting the combination of None aggregation and concat fusion may underperform. However, the exact contribution of each factor remains uncertain without further isolated comparisons."
}

